ong data-start=\"1160\" data-end=\"1176\">slow fashion<\/strong> and minimizing waste. By choosing you\u2019re joining a movement toward <strong data-start=\"1252\" data-end=\"1276\">sustainable clothing<\/strong> that values the planet as much as style. Its minimalist design and neutral tones make it easy to pair with jeans, joggers, or activewear \u2014 perfect for any season.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"981\">Caslay stands as a proud <strong data-start=\"1468\" data-end=\"1497\">sustainable fashion brand<\/strong>, blending innovation with environmental awareness. From eco-conscious sourcing to responsible packaging, every step reflects our dedication to a greener future.<\/p>\n<\/section>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<h3>Key Features:<\/h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>MOQ 100 Units.<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><strong>Price does not include GST, logo printing and delivery charges<\/strong><\/li>\n<li><span data-sheets-userformat=\"{&quot;2&quot;:15107,&quot;3&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:0},&quot;4&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:16250872},&quot;11&quot;:4,&quot;12&quot;:0,&quot;14&quot;:{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:0},&quot;15&quot;:&quot;S\u00f6hne, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, \\&quot;Segoe UI\\&quot;, Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \\&quot;Noto Sans\\&quot;, sans-serif, \\&quot;Helvetica Neue\\&quot;, Arial, \\&quot;Apple Color Emoji\\&quot;, \\&quot;Segoe UI Emoji\\&quot;, \\&quot;Segoe UI Symbol\\&quot;, \\&quot;Noto Color Emoji\\&quot;&quot;,&quot;16&quot;:10}\" data-sheets-value=\"{&quot;1&quot;:2,&quot;2&quot;:&quot;Elevate your style with our Sustainable Sweatshirt, a cozy testament to eco-conscious fashion. Crafted from 60% pre-consumed cotton waste and 40% recycled PET bottle scrap, it showcases our commitment to environmental responsibility and contemporary design. This sweatshirt seamlessly blends comfort and conscious choices, making it a cozy and eco-friendly addition to your wardrobe. Wear your values proudly while staying warm